  data: {
    LLM: 'Watch your train and the one to your right; those are the only places you can play. Slosh as much as you can to get rid of tiles and domino before others.\n\nThe four dead tiles in the boneyard make the game trickier; you can never be sure what tiles are in play. Count exposed tiles in each suit to know what is likely in the hand of the player to your left (who can slosh you).\n\nIf you do not have a protected suit, count tiles exposed in each suit and end your train with the most-played suit so the player to your left is less likely to have a match. If you are running out of plays on your own train, invite a slosh by getting the least-exposed suit on the end of your train to give yourself an opening.',
    Player: 'Watch your train and the one to your right; those are the only places you can play. Slosh as much as you can to get rid of tiles and domino before others.\n\nThe four dead tiles in the boneyard make the game trickier; you can never be sure what tiles are in play. Count exposed tiles in each suit to know what is likely in the hand of the player to your left (who can slosh you).\n\nIf you do not have a protected suit, count tiles exposed in each suit and end your train with the most-played suit so the player to your left is less likely to have a match. If you are running out of plays on your own train, invite a slosh by getting the least-exposed suit on the end of your train to give yourself an opening.',
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
    riskTolerance: 0.5,
    bluffFrequency: 0.3,
